# Every agent appends to these two files, so merge them by keeping both sides' lines
# (git's built-in union driver). Local rebases and merges then resolve them on their own.
# GitHub's merge button doesn't use merge drivers, so if GitHub reports a conflict only in
# these files, rebase locally (AGENTS.md).
docs/HANDOFFS.md merge=union
docs/DECISIONS.md merge=union
